SetVar *result evaluate(None)

GetTableElement username of API_DATA
SetVar *arg_username LASTRESULT

GetTableElement password of API_DATA
SetVar *arg_password LASTRESULT

GetTableElement pic of API_DATA
evaluate {LASTRESULT}[{LASTRESULT}.rindex('/'):]
SetVar *arg_pic LASTRESULT

GetTableElement email of API_DATA
SetVar *arg_email LASTRESULT

GetTableElement role of API_DATA
SetVar *arg_role LASTRESULT

GetTableElement username of API_TOKEN
SetVar *arg_author LASTRESULT

execute app/scripts/db/insertUser.gcs

compare API_RESPONSE 200
if 0 then
	SetVar *result evaluate({'msg': 'User created successfully'})

evaluate {*arg_author} + 'created the user:' + {*arg_username} =>*log_text
execute app/scripts/system/writeLog.gcs

end